{
  "type": "grammar",
  "title": "Prepositions for living: in, an, bei, neben, mit, von, zu",
  "presentation": "card",
  "content": {
    "instructions": "These prepositions are used with the dative when you say where something is, or who or what is with you. Learn them in small phrases.",
    "text": [
      "<table><caption>Prepositions with the dative</caption><thead><tr><th>Preposition</th><th>Listen</th><th>Meaning</th><th>Example</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>in</th><td><span data-audio=\"audio/lo-03-wohnen/u3_g-prepositions-for-living-in-a-01.mp3\" data-audio-label=\"Play row 1\"></span></td><td>in</td><td>in der Stadt, im Zentrum</td></tr><tr><th>an</th><td><span data-audio=\"audio/lo-03-wohnen/u3_g-prepositions-for-living-in-a-02.mp3\" data-audio-label=\"Play row 2\"></span></td><td>at, on (the edge of)</td><td>am Stadtrand, an der Wand</td></tr><tr><th>bei</th><td><span data-audio=\"audio/lo-03-wohnen/u3_g-prepositions-for-living-in-a-03.mp3\" data-audio-label=\"Play row 3\"></span></td><td>at (someone's home), near</td><td>bei meiner Schwester</td></tr><tr><th>neben</th><td><span data-audio=\"audio/lo-03-wohnen/u3_g-prepositions-for-living-in-a-04.mp3\" data-audio-label=\"Play row 4\"></span></td><td>next to</td><td>neben der Küche</td></tr><tr><th>mit</th><td><span data-audio=\"audio/lo-03-wohnen/u3_g-prepositions-for-living-in-a-05.mp3\" data-audio-label=\"Play row 5\"></span></td><td>with, by</td><td>mit dem Fahrrad, mit meiner Katze</td></tr><tr><th>von</th><td><span data-audio=\"audio/lo-03-wohnen/u3_g-prepositions-for-living-in-a-06.mp3\" data-audio-label=\"Play row 6\"></span></td><td>from, of</td><td>nicht weit vom Bahnhof</td></tr><tr><th>zu</th><td><span data-audio=\"audio/lo-03-wohnen/u3_g-prepositions-for-living-in-a-07.mp3\" data-audio-label=\"Play row 7\"></span></td><td>to</td><td>ein Fenster zum Garten</td></tr><tr><th>aus</th><td><span data-audio=\"audio/lo-03-wohnen/u3_g-prepositions-for-living-in-a-08.mp3\" data-audio-label=\"Play row 8\"></span></td><td>from, out of</td><td>aus Leipzig</td></tr></tbody></table>",
      "Ich wohne bei meiner Schwester. Ich fahre mit dem Fahrrad zur Uni."
    ]
  }
}
